{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":105,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":105,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%A9%BA/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"","given_name":"空","family_name_jp":"","given_name_jp":"ソラ","family_name_kr":"","given_name_kr":"소라","family_name_en":"","given_name_en":"Sora","family_name_zh_tw":"","given_name_zh_tw":"空","family_name_cn":"","given_name_cn":"空","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"","main_relation":0,"relation":null,"age":1,"grade":"","height":1,"birthday":null,"hobby":"","designer":"Hwansang","illustrator":"Hwansang","character_voice":"林鼓子","character_voice_cn":"汪悦","release_date":null,"release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":null,"school":16,"weapon_type":"","is_install":false,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":false,"is_npc":true,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Small","special_appearance":true,"spine":[28,540,734],"model":[120],"voice":[{"description":"Sora_Shop_In_1","category":"other","text":"欢，欢，欢迎您！……老师！","text_original":"い、い、いらっしゃいませ！ …先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/j6NJvh0hnGYtdpA8OXQ3dAZP17QtRoCR.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_In_2","category":"other","text":"好无聊啊…… ……呜啊！？您，您什么时候来的？！","text_original":"暇だなぁ…。 …え、うわあ！？ い、いつから来てました？！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/rjJj7RCyyvEpEME0LghvBgTeDazSok9x.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Out_1","category":"other","text":"多谢您今天的惠顾！","text_original":"ありがとうございました！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/JWx0cxWQMzoqa0y181RHu6Fb6B7GmF0p.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Out_2","category":"other","text":"欢迎您下次再来，老师！","text_original":"また来てくださいね、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/YfrgfpdUWeOuPnanksZqcvRlM3AXDKRl.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_1","category":"other","text":"呀！请，请您别碰我的额头！","text_original":"ひぁっ！お、おでこは 触らないでください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/ttw5iZFHkkm2beokoywZRguxJnLWttEQ.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_2","category":"other","text":"我，我觉得……执行任务，应该要做好充分的准备！","text_original":"任務には…その、 じゅ、充分な準備が必要だと 思います！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/v2tUiyu7PHXCB52cITlGABMpdwnrZuy4.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_3","category":"other","text":"所以……还是建议您多买一点！大家都说，在我们店里买东西很划算！","text_original":"ですから…いっぱい買った方が いいですよ！うちのお店の物は買った方が 絶対にお得ですって！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/PUciSJ3nsrxmwAKnN6HpZnQm4ievdHOs.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_4","category":"other","text":"呃，老师，您一直这么盯着我看，我会不好意思的……！","text_original":"あ、あの、そんなにじっと 見つめられると 困ってしまうのですが…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/coalik6zTNxSvuKjwZk0ufYfa83nB4Ne.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_5","category":"other","text":"可以请您……给我看一下大人的卡片吗？","text_original":"大人のカード…見せていただいても よろしいでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/ycbBe2uihqrXEoBTSU9WrTj23iqmKrem.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_6","category":"other","text":"可，可是……我觉得我们店的价格真的很良心了！","text_original":"で、ですが…うちのお店は！ すごく良心的なお値段ですから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/Sl6P94fCjW7rPAoqZXEHjHfQN8xlSWyL.ogg"},{"description":"Sora_Shop_Talk_7","category":"other","text":"一天24小时，您随时都可以来光顾！毕竟这里算是便利店嘛！","text_original":"24時間！いつでも訪問してください！ コンビニみたいなものですから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/NPIcRpYMOJTe0ck2zI5uJmxPzop5cUDo.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"sora_shop_in_2","category":"other","text":"好无聊啊…… ……呜啊！？您，您什么时候来的？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/wznTSSMHMWnjlyP3jbQuzpEf6vlojfwe.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_out_1","category":"other","text":"多谢您今天的惠顾！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/vjRYNUl1yTGneHuFxoxizwGuRazxt4zt.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_out_2","category":"other","text":"欢迎您下次再来，老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/QMJBwi57LqYassZ0MsmycgYPKNotqsxG.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_1","category":"other","text":"呀！请，请您别碰我的额头！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/QfGnwnDBxtvINsU45yA79zggBykNuSbK.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_2","category":"other","text":"我，我觉得……执行任务，应该要做好充分的准备！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/g8selUooqjMaeyOObQWK6z1h4jL1LXCi.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_3","category":"other","text":"所以……还是建议您多买一点！大家都说，在我们店里买东西很划算！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/vILvniEY9M7h6L8k4BtI1IFnANGv2fXm.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_4","category":"other","text":"呃，老师，您一直这么盯着我看，我会不好意思的……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/sPINwqBKjOoeqVWMEZcUpN0ebeVhE54M.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_5","category":"other","text":"可以请您……给我看一下大人的卡片吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/umalUf2XyOuxzR90pE5ApQ9Y0fT1RI5M.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_6","category":"other","text":"可，可是……我觉得我们店的价格真的很良心了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/I0EXKpDfqNkOQ7RWl6nwKS2mkO0bunL4.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_7","category":"other","text":"一天24小时，您随时都可以来光顾！毕竟这里算是便利店嘛！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/wCYHdSKhl6qidmFlLvsCYBAyxMNRzLyy.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_in_1","category":"other","text":"欢，欢，欢迎您！……老师！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A9%BA/viKC4SXrnUUuE44bJHu8XLyZDzBXxhrw.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"sora_shop_talk_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%20%E7%A9%BA/original/sora_shop_talk_3.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%20%E7%A9%BA/original/sora_shop_talk_4.ogg"},{"description":"sora_shop_talk_5","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/s